285
00:23:27,946 --> 00:23:30,146
光を浴びた
I was basked in light

286
00:23:30,146 --> 00:23:32,846
数えた足跡など
Counting the footprints I left behind,

287
00:23:32,846 --> 00:23:35,346
気付けば数字でしかない
I realized they're nothing more than numbers

288
00:23:35,346 --> 00:23:37,746
知らなきゃいけない事は
The thing I need to know

289
00:23:37,746 --> 00:23:40,246
どうやら１と０の間
seems to lie somewhere between one and zero

290
00:23:40,246 --> 00:23:42,846
初めて僕らは出会うだろう
For the first time, we will meet each other,

291
00:23:42,846 --> 00:23:45,346
同じ悲鳴の旗を目印にして
guided by the banner of our matching cries

292
00:23:45,346 --> 00:23:48,046
忘れないで いつだって呼んでるから
Don't ever forget, 'cause I'm calling to you always

293
00:23:48,046 --> 00:23:50,846
重ねた理由を ２人で埋める時
When we bury our overlapping reasons together,

294
00:23:50,846 --> 00:23:55,246
約束が交わされる
our promise is made

295
00:24:01,846 --> 00:24:04,246
鏡なんだ 僕ら互いに
We are mirrors to each other,

296
00:24:04,246 --> 00:24:08,046
それぞれのカルマを映す為の
