...is that you don't notice it yourself.

316
00:26:08,894 --> 00:26:11,294
唯一ある予防法は
The only preventive measure...

317
00:26:11,294 --> 00:26:13,894
「自分にウソだけはつかない事」
...is "never lying to yourself."

318
00:26:14,594 --> 00:26:17,394
忘れてたまるもんかよ！！
As if I'd ever forget that!

319
00:26:17,394 --> 00:26:20,594
