326
00:26:36,594 --> 00:26:39,094
届くまで止めない！！
I won't stop until it reaches you!

327
00:26:50,094 --> 00:26:53,094
今日も地球は 回り続ける
The Earth keeps spinning today as well,

328
00:26:53,094 --> 00:26:56,094
誰が泣いても怒っても止まらず
without stopping no matter who cries or gets angry.

329
00:26:56,094 --> 00:26:58,894
ためしに僕が 風邪をひいても
Even if I happen to catch a cold,

330
00:26:58,894 --> 00:27:01,894
