of course it won't stop for me!

331
00:27:02,094 --> 00:27:04,894
人生も同じように
Life moves forward the same way,

332
00:27:04,894 --> 00:27:07,594
止まる事はなく進むし
without ever coming to a stop,

333
00:27:07,594 --> 00:27:10,594
