so that's why people today too...

334
00:27:10,594 --> 00:27:13,594
お手手のシワとシワをあわせんの！
...press their hands together in prayer!

335
00:27:13,594 --> 00:27:16,894
終わらせちまう事なんか
Anyone can just end things,

336
00:27:16,894 --> 00:27:19,594
